Implements production-ready Flutter Web UI for CI/CD pipeline management with edge-based ML predictions, real-time WebSocket updates, and agent orchestration.

## Core Infrastructure

- **API Client** (`core/api_client.dart`) - HTTP communication with graceful mock fallback for offline development
- **WebSocket Client** (`core/websocket_client.dart`) - Auto-reconnecting real-time updates with stream-based messaging
- **Edge ML Engine** (`core/edge_ml_engine.dart`) - Client-side linear regression for build time predictions and anomaly detection

## Features

### Dashboard
Real-time statistics grid with agent status monitoring and activity feed. Pull-to-refresh for manual updates.

### Agents
Execute and monitor 4 specialized agents (Build, Security, Deploy, Orchestrator) with modal dialogs showing execution status.

### Analytics
Interactive dual-line charts using `fl_chart`: historical build times + ML-predicted future values rendered client-side.

```dart
// Edge ML prediction example
final mlEngine = EdgeMLEngine();
final predictions = await mlEngine.predictPattern(historicalData);
// Returns 5 future predictions with seeded variance
```

## Testing

- 17 test cases: 13 unit (core services), 4 integration (user flows)
- Mock data ensures tests run without backend dependency

## Deployment

- Vercel config with SPA routing and security headers (COOP, COEP)
- Build script automates Flutter Web compilation
- Environment variable support for API URLs

## Documentation

- `USER_GUIDE.md` - End-user instructions
- `TESTING.md` - Test strategies and patterns
- `ARCHITECTURE.md` - System design with data flow diagrams
- `IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md` - Component inventory and metrics

## Stack

Flutter 3.0+, Material Design 3, Provider state management, fl_chart visualization library.

