- **Tests**: Add comprehensive guard verification (5 test cases covering various ENVIRONMENT values)

## Example

```typescript
// Before: Negative check
if (process.env.APP_ENV === "aws-dev" || process.env.APP_ENV === "aws-prod") {
  process.exit(1);
}

// After: Positive assertion
if (process.env.ENVIRONMENT !== "test") {
  console.error("ERROR: migrate:down is only allowed in test environment");
  process.exit(1);
}
```

```json
